評","text":"一、為民服務。\n二、爭取東勢鄉民福利。\n三、創造東勢鄉繁榮。","unresolved":0},{"document":"bulletin-10-009-140-02","entity":"2022-township-representative:10-009-140-02:4","id":"10-009-140-02-4-p1","image":null,"method":"模型判讀","ocr_check":null,"page":1,"reason":"政見取自東勢鄉第2選舉區公報號次4的政見欄；公報沒有文字層，照 3 px/pt 渲染圖轉錄；三條各一行，由上而下轉錄，句末無標點；沒有圖形。政見欄只寫爭取鄉內建設、監督鄉政與傾聽民意，沒有寫出建設項目，沒有主張","review_status":"未經獨立複評","text":"1.永續服務爭取鄉內建設\n2.監督鄉政\n3.傾聽鄉民的聲音","unresolved":0}],"specificity":[{"claim":"10-009-140-02-1-001","criterion":"conditions","evidence":null,"id":"10-009-140-02-1-001-conditions","level":"unstated","method":"模型判讀","reason":"原文沒有寫出適用條件、排除對象或替代方案","review_status":"未經獨立複評","value":0.0},{"claim":"10-009-140-02-1-001","criterion":"funding","evidence":null,"id":"10-009-140-02-1-001-funding","level":"unstated","method":"模型判讀","reason":"原文沒有說明經費從哪裡來","review_status":"未經獨立複評","value":0.0},{"claim":"10-009-140-02-1-001","criterion":"implementation","evidence":null,"id":"10-009-140-02-1-001-implementation","level":"unstated","method":"模型判讀","reason":"原文沒有說明由哪個單位、以什麼程序執行","review_status":"未經獨立複評","value":0.0},{"claim":"10-009-140-02-1-001","criterion":"instrument","evidence":null,"id":"10-009-140-02-1-001-instrument","level":"unstated","method":"模型判讀","reason":"原文只寫出目標或方向，沒有寫出採用的措施","review_status":"未經獨立複評","value":0.0},{"claim":"10-009-140-02-1-001","criterion":"quantity","evidence":null,"id":"10-009-140-02-1-001-quantity","level":"unstated","method":"模型判讀","reason":"原文沒有可以核對的數字","review_status":"未經獨立複評","value":0.0},{"claim":"10-009-140-02-1-001","criterion":"schedule","evidence":null,"id":"10-009-140-02-1-001-schedule","level":"unstated","method":"模型判讀","reason":"原文沒有寫出時間安排","review_status":"未經獨立複評","value":0.0},{"claim":"10-009-140-02-1-001","criterion":"target","evidence":null,"id":"10-009-140-02-1-001-target","level":"unstated","method":"模型判讀","reason":"原文沒有指出適用的群體、地域或設施","review_status":"未經獨立複評","value":0.0},{"claim":"10-009-140-02-1-002","criterion":"conditions","evidence":null,"id":"10-009-140-0